    "title": "Lost potbellied pig takes up temporary residence in Detroit neighborhood - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 hours ago DETROIT – A potbellied pig has become an unexpected visitor in a Detroit neighborhood after apparently wandering away from its home and settling near a pine tree. Chris Lompra, who has lived in the neighborhood for 26 years, said the pig showed up Tuesday (Sep. 1) after running from a nearby park and has remained in the area. Read full article\n1",
